---
// About section. Drop an image at /public/images/about.jpg to show a portrait.
---

<section id="about" class="about reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow">/ about</p>
  <h2 class="prose-h">
    I'm <em>Aishwarya.</em> By day I design products at a startup you probably haven't heard of yet, by night I overthink the tiny details that make an interface feel like it was made by a real person.
  </h2>
  <p class="prose-p">
    Five years in, I've shipped work across AI-first consumer apps, enterprise dashboards, CRM, cloud tooling, and payments. What ties all of it together is the same question: how do we make this thing feel honest?
  </p>
  <p class="prose-meta">Bengaluru › Create › Consume</p>

  <ul class="strip-list">
    <li>Tata Neu</li>
    <li class="dot">·</li>
    <li>Automotive OEMs</li>
    <li class="dot">·</li>
    <li>Cloud platforms</li>
    <li class="dot">·</li>
    <li>Consumer AI</li>
    <li class="dot">·</li>
    <li>Payments</li>
    <li class="dot">·</li>
    <li>Enterprise SaaS</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 6rem;
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .prose-h {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .prose-p {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .prose-meta {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .strip-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .strip-list .dot {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
